# opencode model reel: QA family slug -> published full model name.
# The QA pod emits demos/opencode-<family>.{gif,webm}; `make opencode-reel`
# renames to the full model name and transcodes webm -> mp4 into demos/.
# One "family full-name" pair per line; blank lines and # comments ignored.
#
# Only families with a validated-good render belong here. Models kept from a
# prior reel (MiniMax-M2, Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507, GLM-4.6,
# Hermes-3-Llama-3.1-8B, functionary-small-v3.2) are managed directly in demos/
# and intentionally omitted so a stale/broken incoming render can't overwrite them.
gpt-oss gpt-oss-120b
qwen3-coder Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct
mistral-nemo Mistral-Nemo-Instruct-2407
llama3 Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct
granite granite-3.3-8b-instruct
deepseek-r1-llama DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B
deepseek-r1-qwen DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B
gemma4 gemma-4-E2B-it
phi4mini Phi-4-mini-instruct
qwen3 Qwen3-4B
smollm SmolLM3-3B
